{"unit_id":"Zhuang-A__dsh-go-sensei#feature-1","repo":"Zhuang-A/dsh-go-sensei","commit":"b206647cbf634d7142fad9c767e6d65e9b1442bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepGo Sensei 的棋谱解析功能：读取 SGF 并返回棋局信息、主变化线的手数与坐标，也识别常见棋谱编码和已有分析数据。调用 go_parse_sgf 并提供棋谱路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.js:271","src/sgf.js:450"]}
{"unit_id":"Zhuang-A__dsh-go-sensei#feature-2","repo":"Zhuang-A/dsh-go-sensei","commit":"b206647cbf634d7142fad9c767e6d65e9b1442bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepGo Sensei 的问题手复盘功能：比较每手前后的胜率与目差，筛出超过阈值的候选并按严重度排序；无分析数据时可在引擎可用时补算。调用 go_review_moves 并指定棋谱路径或手数范围。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.js:342","src/review.js:71"]}
{"unit_id":"Zhuang-A__dsh-go-sensei#feature-3","repo":"Zhuang-A/dsh-go-sensei","commit":"b206647cbf634d7142fad9c767e6d65e9b1442bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepGo Sensei 的逐手上下文功能：围绕指定手返回前后手序列、AI 候选变化和当前胜率或目差，便于追问某个下法。调用 go_position_context 并提供棋谱路径和手数。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.js:477"]}
{"unit_id":"Zhuang-A__dsh-go-sensei#feature-4","repo":"Zhuang-A/dsh-go-sensei","commit":"b206647cbf634d7142fad9c767e6d65e9b1442bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepGo Sensei 的变化图功能：把某手局面、候选变化和重点棋子标记绘制成图，可附图注；在支持的 Web 面板中返回可嵌入的图片行。调用 go_draw_diagram 并提供棋谱路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.js:766"]}
{"unit_id":"Zhuang-A__dsh-go-sensei#feature-5","repo":"Zhuang-A/dsh-go-sensei","commit":"b206647cbf634d7142fad9c767e6d65e9b1442bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepGo Sensei 的讲解保存功能：将逐手讲解写入同目录的 -sensei.sgf 副本的 C[] 注释，便于其他支持注释的打谱软件查看。调用 go_write_review 并传入手数与讲解文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.js:588"]}
